* TUBE COMP - PROVISIONAL NONLINEAR CELL LIBRARY (NOT YET HARDWARE-CALIBRATED)
* First engineering guesses for qualitative behavior and numeric methods.
* Triode space-charge equations are original engineering approximations motivated
* by Child-Langmuir / Koren modeling; parameters NOT fitted to 6BC8/6CG7 curves.
* Never cite predicted absolute THD or operating points as measured hardware.
.subckt V6BC8 P G K
* Dual triode half. Remote cutoff sensitivity is grid-bias dependent.
BPL P K I={5.0e-4*pow(uramp(V(G,K)+uramp(V(P,K))/32),1.5)*(uramp(V(P,K))/(18+uramp(V(P,K))))}
Rleak P K 1000Meg
CGK G K 2.4p
CGA G P 2.1p
CPK P K 2.2p
.ends V6BC8

.subckt V6CG7 P G K
BPL P K I={9.0e-4*pow(uramp(V(G,K)+uramp(V(P,K))/21),1.5)*(uramp(V(P,K))/(28+uramp(V(P,K))))}
Rleak P K 1000Meg
CGK G K 2.3p
CGA G P 3p
CPK P K 2.5p
.ends V6CG7

* Dual diode 6AL5: preliminary valve-diode characteristic; NOT calibrated.
.model D6AL5 D(Is=3n N=1.55 Rs=600 Cjo=2.5p M=0.40 Tt=65n)
